        502.0729675292969,
        380.81494140625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the derivation of asymptotic and ﬁnite-sample accuracy guarantees using random set theory. This",
      "bbox": [
        109.92520141601562,
        383.8633728027344,
        502.07293701171875,
        392.7699279785156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "analysis informs algorithmic design to obtain an ϵ-close reachable set approximation with high",
      "bbox": [
